%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/multipart_test.clj:23 (field-test)
testing: Create field part with 3 args
元の形: multipart/field の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import field from dw::module::Multipart
output application/json
---
field("name", "value", "text/plain")
%%% output application/json
{
  "headers": {
    "Content-Type": "text/plain",
    "Content-Disposition": {
      "name": "name"
    }
  },
  "content": "value"
}
